#: ../../source/use-cases/climate-data-kenya.md:1
msgid "Climate data (Kenya)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-cases/climate-data-kenya.md:3
msgid ""
"The Demography Project used ODE to check and correct errors in a giant "
"spreadsheet of air quality data, enabling accurate analysis."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-cases/climate-data-kenya.md:5
msgid ""
"These tables, which compile data from different sources (including two "
"portable air quality monitors, GPS devices, smartphones), had many "
"inconsistencies that were detected in seconds. Once the errors have been "
"identified, they could then correct the missing or incorrect data, "
"increasing the dataset’s quality."
msgstr ""

